{"steamAppId":244090,"description":"Battle to Rule the Pacific Skies!\nTake flight over the treacherous Pacific waters where ace pilots redefine historic World War II battles! Skillfully pilot the most iconic American and Japanese fighter planes of the Pacific War while representing the army or navy. Upgrade your fighters and promote your leading pilots so they master new skills needed to ambush an enemy VIP, rescue POW pilots or torpedo bomb enemy targets! Can you turn the tide of war? Or will you go down in flames to an enemy ace?\n\nKey Features:\nEnlist in over 180 missions set in iconic WWII battles like Pearl Harbor, Midway and Guadalcanal \n\nExpertly pilot fleets of American or Japanese aircraft while representing the army or navy \n\nEarn promotions, equipment upgrades and advanced Ace maneuvers \nPersonalize your pilot profile and aircraft to set you apart in battle \nSingle Player campaign & Hot Seat Multiplayer missions with leaderboards","short_description":"Battle to Rule the Pacific Skies!Take flight over the treacherous Pacific waters where ace pilots redefine historic World War II battles! Skillfully pilot the most iconic American and Japanese fighter planes of the Pacific War while representing the army or navy.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/244090/header.jpg?t=1568756707","developer":"Firaxis Games","publisher":"2K","genre":"Казуальные игры, Стратегии","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская"],"playerCount":2,"releaseLabel":"5 ноя. 2013 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":63,"steamReviewCount":463,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/244090/ss_b9afa52efb77fbae7302df270cdb7489c699383f.600x338.jpg?t=1568756707","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/244090/ss_b9afa52efb77fbae7302df270cdb7489c699383f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1568756707"},{"id":1,"imag